  "benefits": "> **Beneficiary-based subsidy:**\n\n\n- 50% for other categories.\n- 70% for Most Backward Castes, Scheduled Castes, and Scheduled Tribes.\n- 40% Entrepreneur-based subsidy.\n\n",
